## 📦 راه‌اندازی و استقرار (Deployment)

### 1. نصب محلی (Local Setup)
```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/aivora-ai/core.git
cd core

# Setup environment
cp .env.example .env
# Configure your API keys in .env

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run database migrations
npm run db:migrate
npm run db:seed

# Start development server
npm run dev
```

### 2. استقرار ابری (AWS Example)
```bash
# Initialize Terraform
terraform init infrastructure/terraform/aws

# Configure variables
cat > infrastructure/terraform/aws/terraform.tfvars <<EOF
region = "us-east-1"
project_name = "aivora-prod"
instance_type = "t4g.2xlarge"
EOF

# Apply infrastructure
terraform apply infrastructure/terraform/aws

# Deploy application
npm run deploy:production
```

### 3. تنظیمات ضروری در .env
```ini
# Database
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/aivora"

# Security
JWT_SECRET="your_strong_secret_here"
SESSION_SECRET="another_strong_secret"

# AI Providers (Optional - can be empty for local models)
OPENAI_API_KEY=""
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
OLLAMA_HOST="http://localhost:11434"

# File Storage
MINIO_ENDPOINT="localhost"
MINIO_PORT=9000
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY="aivora"
